    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Bed/3 Bath detached, beautifully presented residence set on a generous private site of 0.22 hectares in a peaceful countryside setting, while remaining conveniently close to Knockmore village, Ballina, Foxford and surrounding amenities.\n\nThis impressive home is approached by a large gravel driveway with ample parking and enjoys well-maintained lawns, defined boundaries and attractive panoramic rural views. The property is bright and exceptionally well cared for throughout, offering spacious family accommodation in a scenic yet accessible location.\n\nExternally, the home is complemented by a detached garage, extensive grounds and a superb site layout that provides privacy together with excellent outdoor space for family living. \n\nThis is an ideal opportunity to acquire a substantial turnkey family home in a sought-after country location, combining space, comfort, efficiency and lifestyle appeal.\n\nFeatures:\n\nDetached four-bedroom/three bath family home\nViews of lake from first floor\nSpacious private site with landscaped lawns\nLarge gravel driveway with ample parking\nDetached garage\nBright interior\nScenic countryside views\nConvenient to Knockmore, Ballina and Foxford\nSpacious 185sq meters family home sitting on circa 0.22 hectares\nGood spacious living accommodation throughout.\n"
      },
